%% Meridian Diagram 03: Research Job End-to-End Flow
flowchart LR
    classDef user fill:#F9F7D9,stroke:#B58B00,color:#2F2F2F,stroke-width:1px;
    classDef api fill:#DCEBFF,stroke:#2C5AA0,color:#1E2A3A,stroke-width:1px;
    classDef ai fill:#E8F6FF,stroke:#0F6FA5,color:#173347,stroke-width:1px;
    classDef data fill:#E2F7E2,stroke:#2E7D32,color:#1F3A1F,stroke-width:1px;
    classDef state fill:#FFE6DE,stroke:#B5522D,color:#462014,stroke-width:1px;

    U[Browser User]
    API[Spring Boot API]
    AI[FastAPI AI Service]
    R[(Redis Events + Checkpoints)]
    DB[(PostgreSQL)]

    U -->|createResearchJob mutation| API
    API -->|validate ownership + active jobs <= 3| API
    API -->|create job PENDING| DB
    API -->|POST /jobs/start| AI
    AI -->|checkpoint write| R
    API -->|update RUNNING| DB

    U -->|GET /ai/stream/{id}?token=jwt| AI
    AI -->|XREAD stream loop| R
    AI -->|SSE agent_update| U

    AI --> P[Planner]
    P --> RS[Research]
    RS --> Q{Depth = quick?}
    Q -->|Yes| SY[Synthesizer]
    Q -->|No| AN[Analysis]
    AN --> CR[Critic]
    CR --> L{score < 7 and\niterations < 3?}
    L -->|Yes| AN
    L -->|No| SY
    SY -->|emit job_complete| R

    AI -->|Webhook complete| API
    API -->|create report + mark COMPLETE| DB
    AI -->|SSE job_complete| U
    U -->|open /jobs/{id}/report| API

    P:::ai
    RS:::ai
    AN:::ai
    CR:::ai
    SY:::ai
    U:::user
    API:::api
    AI:::ai
    R:::data
    DB:::data
    Q:::state
    L:::state
